## 📐 Schema Structure

### Pattern

```javascript
// backend/export/schemas/{report-type}.js
export default {
    title: 'REPORT TITLE',
    subtitle: 'Report Subtitle Description',
    columns: [
        { 
            key: 'column_name',      // Database field name
            label: 'Column Label',   // Excel header
            width: 15,               // Column width in chars
            align: 'center',         // left|center|right
            format: 'number'         // number|percentage|date (optional)
        },
        // ... more columns
    ]
};
```

### Format Types

- `number`: Integer display
- `percentage`: 0.00% format
- `date`: DD/MM/YYYY format
- (none): Text format

