## 🎨 Logo Embedding (excelBuilder.js)

### Implementation

```javascript
// Support base64 images
if (letterhead.logoLeftUrl) {
    try {
        let imageBuffer;
        if (letterhead.logoLeftUrl.startsWith('data:image/')) {
            // Extract base64 data
            const base64Data = letterhead.logoLeftUrl.split(',')[1];
            imageBuffer = base64Data;
        }
        
        if (imageBuffer) {
            const imageId = workbook.addImage({
                base64: imageBuffer,
                extension: 'png',
            });
            
            worksheet.addImage(imageId, {
                tl: { col: 0, row: currentRow - 1 },
                ext: { width: 60, height: 60 }
            });
        }
    } catch (error) {
        console.warn('Failed to add left logo:', error.message);
    }
}
```

### Logo Requirements

- **Format**: Base64 encoded PNG (`data:image/png;base64,...`)
- **Size**: 60x60 pixels recommended
- **Position**: 
  - Left logo: Column 0 (first column)
  - Right logo: Last column
- **Row Height**: 60 pixels reserved for logos

