## ✅ Best Practices

### 1. Always Use Daily Logic for Summary Reports
- Teacher summary
- Student summary  
- Rekap ketidakhadiran

### 2. Parameter Validation
```javascript
if (!startDate || !endDate) {
    return res.status(400).json({ error: 'Missing parameters' });
}
```

### 3. Letterhead Fallback
Always provide default letterhead jika config tidak ada di database.

### 4. Error Handling
```javascript
try {
    // Export logic
} catch (error) {
    console.error('❌ Export error:', error);
    res.status(500).json({ 
        success: false, 
        error: 'Export failed',
        message: error.message 
    });
}
```

### 5. File Naming Convention
```javascript
const filename = `{report-type}-${startDate}-${endDate}.xlsx`;
```

### 6. Console Logging
```javascript
console.log(`📊 Exporting {report-type}: ${startDate} to ${endDate}`);
console.log(`✅ Retrieved ${data.length} records`);
console.log(`✅ Export successful: ${filename}`);
```

