## 🚨 Common Pitfalls

### ❌ DON'T: Calculate presentase per mapel
```javascript
// BAD - mengabaikan daily logic
const presentase = hadir / total_sessions;
```

### ✅ DO: Calculate presentase per hari
```javascript
// GOOD - dengan daily aggregation
const totalHadir = parseInt(row.hadir || 0) + parseInt(row.dispen || 0);
const presentase = totalHadir / totalHari;
```

### ❌ DON'T: Hardcode letterhead
```javascript
// BAD
const letterhead = { enabled: true, ... };
```

### ✅ DO: Fetch from database with fallback
```javascript
// GOOD
const [data] = await db.execute('SELECT config_value FROM system_config...');
let letterhead = data.length > 0 ? JSON.parse(data[0].config_value) : defaultLetterhead;
```

